stias de las digestiones pesadas\n- *Poleo menta:* digestivo y carminativo, ayuda a reducir la sensación de hinchazón\n- *Ajedrea:* favorece la digestión y tiene efecto antiespasmódico\n- *Melisa:* digestiva, ayuda a calmar las molestias estomacales\n\n**Cómo prepararla**\n- Calienta el agua a 95 °C\n- Infusiona 5 minutos con tapa para no perder los aromas\n- Fíltrala y disfrútala\n\n**Consejo:** también está deliciosa en frío. Solo tienes que añadirle hielo o enfriarla en la nevera.\n\n**Contraindicaciones:** no recomendada durante el embarazo ni la lactancia.\n\n**Compromiso**\n- Cultivo ecológico\n- Producción sostenible\n- Comercio de proximidad\n- Packaging sostenible	**Organic Digest Herbal Tea**, created to support digestion and look after your digestive system. A synergy of organically grown aromatic herbs that gives it a balanced flavour with a fresh, floral note. *Caffeine-free.*\n\nA digestive infusion, ideal after heavy meals.\n\n**Format:** 40 g tin, approximately 50 cups.\n\n**Ingredients and properties**\n- *Chamomile:* digestive and soothing, traditionally used to ease the discomfort of heavy digestion\n- *Pennyroyal:* digestive and carminative, helps reduce bloating\n- *Savory:* supports digestion and has an antispasmodic effect\n- *Lemon balm:* digestive, helps soothe stomach discomfort\n\n**How to prepare it**\n- Heat water to 95 °C\n- Steep for 5 minutes with the lid on to keep the aromas in\n- Strain and enjoy\n\n**Tip:** it's also delicious cold. Just add ice or chill it in the fridge.\n\n**Contraindications:** not recommended during pregnancy or breastfeeding.\n\n**Our commitment**\n- Organic farming\n- Sustainable production\n- Local trade\n- Sustainable packaging	Aromik	6.27	\N	10.00	6.90	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Sense Teïna", "keyEn": "Caffeine-Free", "keyEs": "Sin Teína", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}, {"keyCa": "Ecològica", "keyEn": "Organic", "keyEs": "Ecológica", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "S