ón de líquidos\n- *Melisa:* tradicionalmente utilizada para calmar el sistema nervioso y armonizar las emociones\n- *Hierba luisa:* calmante, con un aroma cítrico y dulce\n\n**Cómo prepararla**\n- Calienta el agua a 95 °C\n- Infusiona 5 minutos con tapa para no perder los aromas\n- Fíltrala y disfrútala\n\n**Consejo:** también está deliciosa en frío. Solo tienes que añadirle hielo o enfriarla en la nevera.\n\n**Contraindicaciones:** no recomendada durante el embarazo.\n\n**Compromiso**\n- Cultivo ecológico\n- Producción sostenible\n- Comercio de proximidad\n- Packaging sostenible	**Organic Harmonia Herbal Tea**, a synergy of aromatic herbs that combines the antioxidant, balancing power of hibiscus with the sweet, citrusy aroma of lemon verbena and lemon balm. Enjoy a unique flavour while bringing harmony to your body. *Caffeine-free.*\n\nA relaxing, diuretic infusion traditionally used to calm the nervous system.\n\n**Format:** 40 g tin, approximately 50 cups.\n\n**Ingredients and properties**\n- *Hibiscus:* rich in antioxidants, with diuretic properties that help release excess fluids\n- *Lemon balm:* traditionally used to calm the nervous system and balance the emotions\n- *Lemon verbena:* soothing, with a sweet, citrusy aroma\n\n**How to prepare it**\n- Heat water to 95 °C\n- Steep for 5 minutes with the lid on to keep the aromas in\n- Strain and enjoy\n\n**Tip:** it's also delicious cold. Just add ice or chill it in the fridge.\n\n**Contraindications:** not recommended during pregnancy.\n\n**Our commitment**\n- Organic farming\n- Sustainable production\n- Local trade\n- Sustainable packaging	Aromik	6.27	\N	10.00	6.90	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Sense Teïna", "keyEn": "Caffeine-Free", "keyEs": "Sin Teína", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}, {"keyCa": "Ecològica", "keyEn": "Organic", "keyEs": "Ecológica", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}]	0	0	2026-09-13 09:51:03.872	2026-11-05 11:34:50.946	11	10	50	10	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-09-1