nja aporta una salida **cítrica y luminosa**, acompañada por el carácter especiado del clavo y la calidez de la canela. Una combinación **cálida, especiada y envolvente**, donde la frescura de la naranja equilibra la intensidad de las especias.	**Discover Spiced Orange before choosing your favourite format, or add it to a personalised gift as a small scented extra.**\n\nA small format made to try the fragrance at home and see how it fits your space.\n\nSpiced Orange combines the **freshness of orange** with the warm character of spices. Orange brings a bright citrus touch, while **cinnamon and clove** add warmth and depth. An intense, enveloping scent that balances freshness and spice without being overly sweet.\n\nUse the Discovery Cube in a wax melt burner to experience the fragrance before choosing it in other formats.\n\n**Contents: approx. 10 g**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Orange · Clove · Cinnamon**\n\nOrange brings a **bright citrus** opening, joined by the spicy character of clove and the warmth of cinnamon. A **warm, spicy and enveloping** combination, where the freshness of orange balances the intensity of the spices.	Talabot Studio	1.65	\N	21.00	2.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Cítric, especiat, càlid i intens", "valueEn": "Citrus, spicy, warm and enveloping", "valueEs": "Cítrico, especiado, cálido y envolvente"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Taronja · Clau · Canyella", "valueEn": "Orange · Clove · Cinnamon", "valueEs": "Naranja · Clavo · Canela"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "1 Discovery Cube", "valueEn": "1 discovery cube", "valueEs": "1 Discovery Cube"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "10 g aprox.", "valueEn": "10 g approx.", "valueEs": "10 g aprox."}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": 