der los aromas\n- Fíltrala y disfrútala, caliente o con hielo\n\n**Contraindicaciones:** sin contraindicaciones conocidas.\n\n**Compromiso**\n- Cultivo ecológico\n- Producción sostenible\n- Comercio de proximidad\n- Packaging sostenible	**Organic lemon verbena**, a delicious, sweet infusion with an unmistakable lemon flavour. One of the most cherished herbs in herbal tradition, both for drinking and for flavouring desserts. *Caffeine-free.*\n\n**Format:** 15 g tin of organically grown dried leaf.\n\n**Properties**\n- Stomach tonic and digestive, ideal after meals\n- Calming, traditionally used to ease nervous tension and support rest\n- Traditionally used to soothe the throat and calm coughs\n\n**Uses**\n- On its own, as a hot or iced infusion\n- To flavour teas, lemonades and infused waters\n- In the kitchen, to flavour desserts, ice cream and custards\n\n**How to prepare it**\n- Heat water to 95 °C\n- Steep for 5 minutes with the lid on to keep the aromas in\n- Strain and enjoy, hot or over ice\n\n**Contraindications:** no known contraindications.\n\n**Our commitment**\n- Organic farming\n- Sustainable production\n- Local trade\n- Sustainable packaging	Aromik	5.45	\N	10.00	6.00	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Sense Teïna", "keyEn": "Caffeine-Free", "keyEs": "Sin Teína", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}, {"keyCa": "Ecològica", "keyEn": "Organic", "keyEs": "Ecológica", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}]	0	0	2026-09-13 13:30:34.226	2026-11-05 11:34:51.1	11	10	25	10	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-09-13 13:37:12.042	t	g	15.000	0	f	f	\N	\N	\N	{"storageEs": "Conservar en un lloc fresc i sec.", "allergensEs": "", "businessName": "", "ingredientsEs": "Lippia citridora."}	Cami pla de la torreta 1 bis	Planteles lloveres SL	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f	\N	https://www.aromik.cat/products/maria-lluisa	f	\N	\N	0	{}
