dy, warm and subtle scent, made to create a cosy atmosphere without feeling heavy. A simple, enveloping composition where the woods take centre stage.\n\n**Wood Harmony is leaving Talabot Studio.** The last units are now part of our outlet and, once sold out, will not be made again.\n\n**Last units · Discontinued edition**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Soft amber**\nA light, delicate warmth, neither sweet nor intense.\n\n**Sandalwood**\nA creamy, serene wood with a clean, velvety character.\n\n**Soft wood accords**\nA subtle base that brings a feeling of calm and naturalness.	Talabot Studio	3.31	\N	21.00	4.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Fumat, càlid i suau", "valueEn": "Woody, warm and soft", "valueEs": "Amaderado, cálido y suave"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Ambre suau", "valueEn": "Soft amber", "valueEs": "Ámbar suave"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "58 g", "valueEn": "58 g", "valueEs": "58 g"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Vegetal de soja i coco", "valueEn": "Plant-based soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Vegetal de soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "4,5 × 11,5 cm", "valueEn": "4.5 × 11.5 cm", "valueEs": "4,5 × 11,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Format", "keyEn": "Format", "keyEs": "Formato", "valueCa": "Tauleta de wax melts", "valueEn": "Wax melt bar", "valueEs": "Tableta de wax melts"}, {"keyCa": "Ús", "keyEn": "Use", "keyEs": "Uso", "valueCa": "Cremador de wax melts", "valueEn": "Wax melt burner", "valueEs": "Quemador para wax melts"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Feta a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Handmade in small batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Hecho a mano en pequeños lotes en Barcelona"}, {"keyCa": "Disponibilitat", "keyEn": "Availability",