rácter y profundidad**, envuelto por la calidez del ámbar y un fondo de maderas cálidas. Una composición **intensa, elegante y sofisticada**, con el carácter envolvente de un perfume masculino que permanece en el ambiente.	**Discover Manhattan before choosing your favourite format, or add it to a personalised gift as a small scented extra.**\n\nA small format made to try the fragrance at home and see how it fits your space.\n\nManhattan is an **urban, elegant and deep** fragrance, inspired by the pulse of the city as night falls. Leather brings character and intensity, wrapped in the warmth of amber and a base of warm woods. A **masculine, intense and sophisticated** scent, warm and enveloping.\n\nUse the Discovery Cube in a wax melt burner to experience the fragrance before choosing it in other formats.\n\n**Contents: approx. 10 g**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Leather · Amber · Warm woods**\n\nLeather brings **character and depth**, wrapped in the warmth of amber and a base of warm woods. An **intense, elegant and sophisticated** composition, with the enveloping character of a masculine perfume that lingers in the room.	Talabot Studio	1.65	\N	21.00	2.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Aromàtic, intens i masculí.", "valueEn": "Aromatic, masculine, intense and enveloping", "valueEs": "Aromático, masculino, intenso y envolvente"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Cuir · Ambre · Fustes càlides", "valueEn": "Leather · Amber · Warm woods", "valueEs": "Cuero · Ámbar · Maderas cálidas"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "1 Discovery Cube", "valueEn": "1 discovery cube", "valueEs": "1 Discovery Cube"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "10 g aprox.", "valueEn": "10 g approx.", "valueEs": "10 g aprox."}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas"