flower and a soft fabric-softener accord create a **clean, fresh and comforting** fragrance that is released gradually inside the wardrobe.\n\nMade with plant-based wax and finished by hand with **natural, botanical elements**.\n\nThis scent is also available as a **candle, Wax Melt, 100 ml Home Spray, Tin Pack** and **Discovery Cube.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Cotton · Water flower · Fabric softener**\n\nCotton brings a soft, clean feel, joined by the delicate freshness of water flower. The fabric-softener accord leaves a cosy, familiar base reminiscent of freshly washed fabrics.	Talabot Studio	6.20	\N	21.00	7.50	EUR	6	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Net, fresc i reconfortant", "valueEn": "Clean, fresh and comforting", "valueEs": "Limpio, fresco y reconfortante"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Cotó · Flor d'aigua · Suavitzant", "valueEn": "Cotton · Water flower · Fabric softener", "valueEs": "Algodón · Flor de agua · Suavizante"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Vegetal de soja i coco", "valueEn": "Plant-based soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Vegetal de soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "70 g", "valueEn": "70g", "valueEs": "70g"}, {"keyCa": "Format", "keyEn": "Format", "keyEs": "Formato", "valueCa": "Ambientador sòlid penjant", "valueEn": "Hanging solid air freshener", "valueEs": "Ambientador sólido colgante"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "5 × 9,5 cm", "valueEn": "5 × 9.5 cm", "valueEs": "5 × 9,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Color", "keyEn": "Colour", "keyEs": "Color", "valueCa": "Blanc amb elements naturals i botànics", "valueEn": "White with natural, botanical elements", "valueEs": "Blanco con elementos naturales y botánicos"}, {"keyCa": "Presentació", "keyEn": "Packaging", "keyEs": "Presentación", "valueCa": "Inclou bo