alo y disfrútalo, caliente o con hielo\n\n**Contraindicaciones:** no recomendado durante el embarazo.\n\n**Compromiso**\n- Cultivo ecológico\n- Producción sostenible\n- Comercio de proximidad\n- Packaging sostenible	**Organic oregano**, a herb with an intense, herbal aroma, essential in Mediterranean cooking and with a long tradition as an infusion. *Caffeine-free.*\n\n**Format:** 35 g tin of organically grown dried leaf.\n\n**Properties**\n- A great ally of the digestive system: that's why it has traditionally been used to season slow-to-digest dishes like pasta and pizza\n- Traditionally used to care for the respiratory system\n- Rich in natural antioxidants\n\n**Uses**\n- In the kitchen, to flavour pizza, sauces, salads, meat and vegetables\n- As a hot or iced infusion after meals\n- To infuse olive oil and vinegars\n\n**How to prepare it**\n- Heat water to 95 °C\n- Steep for 5 minutes with the lid on to keep the aromas in\n- Strain and enjoy, hot or over ice\n\n**Contraindications:** not recommended during pregnancy.\n\n**Our commitment**\n- Organic farming\n- Sustainable production\n- Local trade\n- Sustainable packaging	Aromik	5.45	\N	10.00	6.00	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Ecològica", "keyEn": "Organic", "keyEs": "Ecológico", "valueCa": "Sí", "valueEn": "Yes", "valueEs": "Sí"}]	0	0	2026-09-13 13:20:17.467	2026-11-05 11:34:51.254	11	10	45	10	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-09-13 13:37:14.218	t	g	35.000	1	f	f	\N	\N	\N	{"storageEs": "Conservar en un lloc fresc i sec.", "allergensEs": "", "businessName": "", "ingredientsEs": "Origanum vulgare."}	Cami pla de la torreta 1 bis	Planteles lloveres SL	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f	\N	https://www.aromik.cat/products/orenga-2	f	\N	\N	0	{}
