d**, cremosa y reconfortante.	**El café de la abuela** smells of home, of calm after-lunch chats and of those small rituals that stay in your memory forever.\n\nA candle made in a **vintage porcelain cup with saucer**, where every piece is different and part of a very limited edition.\n\nIts scent combines **creamy coffee, walnut and caramel**, with hints of milk, melted butter and toasted sugar. Warm, gourmand and enveloping, like that coffee that seems to stretch the conversation a little longer.\n\n**Last 3 units of this limited edition. It will not be restocked.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Creamy coffee · Walnut · Caramel**\n\nCoffee brings an intense, roasted and enveloping character, joined by the warmth of **walnut** and the sweetness of caramel. Hints of **milk**, **melted butter** and toasted sugar complete a creamy, comforting **gourmand composition**.	Talabot Studio	11.57	\N	21.00	14.00	EUR	2	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Gourmand · Càlid · Reconfortant", "valueEn": "Gourmand · Warm · Enveloping", "valueEs": "Gourmand · Cálido · Envolvente"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Cafè cremós · Nou · Caramel", "valueEn": "Creamy coffee · Walnut · Caramel", "valueEs": "Café cremoso · Nuez · Caramelo"}, {"keyCa": "Tipus", "keyEn": "Type", "keyEs": "Tipo", "valueCa": "Espelma aromàtica · Edició limitada", "valueEn": "Scented candle · Limited edition", "valueEs": "Vela aromática · Edición limitada"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Tassa vintage de porcellana amb plat", "valueEn": "Vintage porcelain cup with saucer", "valueEs": "Taza vintage de porcelana con plato"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Fusta", "valueEn"