 limpio y confortable. Una composición **floral, elegante y armoniosa**, que evoca un jardín lleno de flores.	**El Jardín de la Abuela** evokes a garden full of flowers, green leaves and memories. A floral, delicate fragrance with that familiar, comforting touch of the gardens of old.\n\nWhite tea flower and lily of the valley bring brightness and freshness, joined by a soft floral accord and a musk base that wraps the composition. A **floral, green and harmonious** scent, elegant without being intense.\n\nAvailable in two sizes: **100 g** with a **Stabilo** wick and **225 g** with a **wooden** wick.\n\nAlso available as an **Arrels Tin Pack**, **Wax Melt** and **Discovery Cube**.\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**White tea flower · Lily of the valley · Musk**\n\nA blend of flowers where **geranium and carnation** add character, joined by the delicacy of white tea flower and lily of the valley. Musk softens the whole with a clean, cosy base. A **floral, elegant and harmonious** composition that evokes a garden full of flowers.	Talabot Studio	8.68	\N	21.00	10.50	EUR	20	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Floral, delicat i harmoniós", "valueEn": "Floral, delicate and enveloping", "valueEs": "Floral, delicado y envolvente"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Flor de te blanc · Muguet · Almesc", "valueEn": "White tea flower · Lily of the valley · Musk", "valueEs": "Flor de té blanco · Muguet · Almizcle"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre ambre amb tapa daurada", "valueEn": "Amber glass with gold lid", "valueEs": "Vidrio ámbar con tapa dorada"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5 × 6 cm (100 g) · Ø 7 × 9 cm (225 g)", "valu