sing well with cold or warm water.\n\nIngredients:\n\nAqua (water), cetyl/stearyl alcohol, hydrolyzed collagen, cyclopentasiloxane (and) dimethiconol, cetrimonium chloride, glycerin, argania spinosa oil caprylic/capric triglycerides, phenyl trimethicone, dimethicone, phenoxyethanol, potassium sorbate, parfum, linalool, hexyl cinnamal.\n\n3 - Argan Oil-Serum\n\nSize: 100 ml\n\nSpecially formulated to protect hair from external agents and the heat of straighteners and dryers, it provides softness and shine like no other, enriched with vitamins and enzymes.\n\nFunctionality:\n\nCorrect split ends.\nFacilitate styling.\nDiscipline hair\nProtect hair from heat from straighteners and dryers.\nEliminate frizz.\n\nInstructions:\n\nApply 2 to 4 drops in the palm of your hand, distribute evenly with the help of a comb. Before styling or straightening, apply to hair from inside out and from top to bottom. After straightening or styling, repeat the process to finish. Do not rinse.\n\nIngredients:\nCyclopentasiloxane, phenyl trimethicone, dimethicone, Elaeis Oleifera kernel oil, cetyl acetate, acetylated lanolin, cyclopentasiloxane, dimethicone, macadamia ternifolia seed oil, PPG-3 benzyl ether myristate, salic cimetilel, hexyl cinnamal, D-Limonene, Mauritia Flexuosa Fruit Oil.	Belma kosmetik	73.55	\N	21.00	89.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[]	0	0	2026-09-29 21:05:32.516	2026-11-05 05:59:57.223	20	20	1100	30	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-11-05 05:59:57.213	t	\N	\N	0	t	f	\N	bhkosmetik@belma.com	BELMA KOSMETIK sucursal Spain	null	Avenida Europa 9POL. DE CONSTANTI. 43120, Constanti (Tarragona)	Belma kosmetik	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	0	{}
