acter, while **freesia** adds a soft, light facet. **Redcurrant** introduces a subtle fruity nuance that adds liveliness and balances the whole.\n\nA **floral, fresh and delicately fruity** scent, bright and elegant.\n\n**Last unit of the summer collection. It will not be restocked.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Peony · Freesia · Redcurrant**\n\nPeony brings a **fresh, delicate** floral facet that combines with the softness of **freesia**. **Redcurrant** adds a fruity, slightly tart nuance that brings brightness and contrast to the composition.	Talabot Studio	5.79	\N	21.00	7.00	EUR	1	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Floral, fresc i afruitat", "valueEn": "Floral · Fresh · Fruity", "valueEs": "Floral · Fresco · Afrutado"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Peònia · Frèsia · Grosella vermella", "valueEn": "Peony · Freesia · Redcurrant", "valueEs": "Peonía · Fresia · Grosella roja"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre ambre amb tapa daurada", "valueEn": "Amber glass with gold lid", "valueEs": "Vidrio ámbar con tapa dorada"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5 × 6 cm", "valueEn": "Ø 5 × 6 cm", "valueEs": "Ø 5 × 6 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Stabilo de cotó", "valueEn": "Stabilo", "valueEs": "Stabilo"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Abocada a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Hand-poured in small batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Vertida a mano en pequeños lotes en Barcelona"}, {"keyCa": "Disponibilitat", "keyEn": "Availability", "keyEs": "Disponibilidad", "valueCa": "Última unitat · Sense reposició", "valueEn": "Las