ion of 1 to 3 units.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Pistachio · Toasted almond · Cream**\n\nPistachio brings the **creamy** character of the composition, joined by the warmth of almond and toasted nuts. The creamy, slightly sweet base rounds off the scent and gives it a rich, **enveloping** texture.	Talabot Studio	8.68	\N	21.00	10.50	EUR	3	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Gurmet · Cremós · Càlid · Intens", "valueEn": "Gourmand · Creamy · Warm · Intense", "valueEs": "Gourmand · Cremoso · Cálido · Intenso"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Festuc · Ametlla torrada · Crema", "valueEn": "Pistachio · Toasted almond · Cream", "valueEs": "Pistacho · Almendra tostada · Crema"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Abocada a mà en micro-lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Hand-poured in micro-batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Vertida a mano en micro lotes en Barcelona"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "100 g", "valueEn": "100 g", "valueEs": "100 g"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre verd amb tapa platejada", "valueEn": "Green glass with silver lid", "valueEs": "Vidrio verde con tapa plateada"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm", "valueEn": "Ø 5 × 6.5 cm", "valueEs": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Stabilo", "valueEn": "Stabilo", "valueEs": "Stabilo"}, {"keyCa": "Edició", "keyEn": "Edition", "keyEs": "Edición", "valueCa": "Entre 1 i 3 unitats", "valueEn": "Between 1 and 3 units", "valueEs": "Entre 1 y 3 unidades"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:09:14.899	2026-11-05 11:33:50.437	9	7	220	7	FET_A_CATALUN