oom spray, with clean notes of **lily of the valley and green melon** resting on a soothing base of **sandalwood**. Ideal for turning your moments of rest, yoga, reading or meditation into a sacred oasis.\n\n- **Effect:** Deep calm, freshness and peace of mind.\n- **Intensity:** Medium-high (instant diffusion).\n- **Format:** 250 ml amber glass bottle with a black sprayer.\n- **Shake** gently before use.\n- **Spray** upwards in the middle of the room or onto home textiles (cushions, curtains or sheets) from at least 30 cm away so the scent settles and lasts much longer.\n- **Store** in a cool place, away from direct sunlight, to preserve the quality of its scent notes.	Komorebi artesanal	13.22	\N	21.00	16.00	EUR	0	NEW	DRAFT	[{"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Lliri de maig · Meló verd · Sàndal", "valueEn": "Lily of the valley · Green melon · Sandalwood", "valueEs": "Lirio de los valles · Melón verde · Sándalo"}, {"keyCa": "Intensitat", "keyEn": "Intensity", "keyEs": "Intensidad", "valueCa": "Mitjana-alta", "valueEn": "Medium-high", "valueEs": "Media-alta"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "250 ml", "valueEn": "250 ml", "valueEs": "250 ml"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre ambre amb polvoritzador negre", "valueEn": "Amber glass bottle with black sprayer", "valueEs": "Vidrio ámbar con pulverizador negro"}, {"keyCa": "Ús", "keyEn": "Use", "keyEs": "Uso", "valueCa": "Tèxtils i ambient", "valueEn": "Fabrics and room", "valueEs": "Textiles y ambiente"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Artesanal", "valueEn": "Handcrafted", "valueEs": "Artesanal"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 07:57:55.156	2026-11-05 11:33:59.468	18	24.5	500	22	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-19 11:56:53.04	t	\N	\N	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Avinguda California 121, 08811 Canyelles (Barcelona), España · komorebiartesanal@gmail.com	Komoreb