ry feeling, inspired by freshly washed fabrics. Musk adds softness and leaves a clean, enveloping base.	Talabot Studio	8.68	\N	21.00	10.50	EUR	3	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Net, fresc i delicat", "valueEn": "Clean, fresh and musky", "valueEs": "Limpio, fresco y almizclado"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Cotó · Lli · Musc", "valueEn": "Cotton · Linen · Musk", "valueEs": "Algodón · Lino · Musk"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "100 g", "valueEn": "100 g", "valueEs": "100 g"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre verd amb tapa platejada", "valueEn": "Green glass with silver lid", "valueEs": "Vidrio verde con tapa plateada"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm", "valueEn": "Ø 5 × 6.5 cm", "valueEs": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Stabilo", "valueEn": "Stabilo", "valueEs": "Stabilo"}, {"keyCa": "Edició", "keyEn": "Edition", "keyEs": "Edición", "valueCa": "Entre 1 i 3 unitats", "valueEn": "Between 1 and 3 units", "valueEs": "Entre 1 y 3 unidades"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Feta a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Hand-poured in micro-batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Vertida a mano en micro lotes en Barcelona"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:09:12.635	2026-11-05 11:33:49.229	9	7	220	7	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-18 22:10:34.585	f	g	100.000	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	null	Carrer de València 190, 08011 Barcelona, España · info@talabotstudio.com	Talabot Studio	IMPORTANTE: En el primer encendido, deja que la cera se funda hasta alcanzar los bordes del recipiente para fa