ven unlit. Its shape plays with light and shadow depending on the angle you look at it from.\n\nAvailable in **two colours: white and mustard**.\n\n**Dimensions:** 22.5 cm high × 6.3 cm wide\n**Weight:** 520 g\n\n**Scent notes**\n\nRipple XXL is an **unscented** candle made with APF wax and conceived mainly as a decorative object. Display it as it is, or light it and enjoy it like a traditional candle.	Talabot Studio	24.79	\N	21.00	30.00	EUR	4	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Forma i volum a gran escala", "valueEn": "Shape and volume on a large scale", "valueEs": "Forma y volumen a gran escala"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "espelma sense perfum", "valueEn": "Unscented", "valueEs": "sin perfume"}, {"keyCa": "Tipus", "keyEn": "Type", "keyEs": "Tipo", "valueCa": "Espelma escultòrica", "valueEn": "Sculptural candle", "valueEs": "Vela escultórica"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Arròs i abella", "valueEn": "Rice and beeswax", "valueEs": "Arroz y abeja"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "520 g aprox.", "valueEn": "520 g approx.", "valueEs": "520 g aprox."}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "22,5 cm d'alt × 6,3 cm d'ample", "valueEn": "22.5 cm high × 6.3 cm wide", "valueEs": "22,5 cm de alto × 6,3 cm de ancho"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Cotó", "valueEn": "Cotton", "valueEs": "Algodón"}, {"keyCa": "Color", "keyEn": "Colour", "keyEs": "Color", "valueCa": "Blanc o mostassa", "valueEn": "White or mustard", "valueEs": "Blanco o mostaza"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Feta a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Hand-poured and unmoulded in small batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Vertida y desmoldada a mano en pequeños lotes en Barcelona"},