ck orchid combines with the delicacy of lily and the freshness of bergamot. A **deep, elegant and enveloping** fragrance that is released gradually, gently perfuming the space.\n\nMade with plant-based wax and finished by hand with **natural, botanical elements**.\n\nThis scent is also available as a **candle**, **Wax Melt**, **100 ml Home Spray**, **Tin Pack** and **Discovery Cube.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Black orchid · Lily · Bergamot**\n\nBergamot brings a fresh, bright opening that contrasts with the depth of black orchid and the floral delicacy of lily. An **intense, elegant and enveloping** composition with a dark, sophisticated floral character.	Talabot Studio	6.20	\N	21.00	7.50	EUR	3	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Floral, fosc i sofisticat", "valueEn": "Floral, dark and sophisticated", "valueEs": "Floral, oscuro y sofisticado"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Orquídia negra · Lliri · Bergamota", "valueEn": "Black orchid · Lily · Bergamot", "valueEs": "Orquídea negra · Lirio · Bergamota"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Vegetal de soja i coco", "valueEn": "Plant-based soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Vegetal de soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "70 g", "valueEn": "70g", "valueEs": "70g"}, {"keyCa": "Format", "keyEn": "Format", "keyEs": "Formato", "valueCa": "Ambientador sòlid penjant", "valueEn": "Hanging solid air freshener", "valueEs": "Ambientador sólido colgante"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "5 × 9,5 cm", "valueEn": "5 × 9.5 cm", "valueEs": "5 × 9,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Color", "keyEn": "Colour", "keyEs": "Color", "valueCa": "Blanc amb elements naturals i botànics", "valueEn": "White with natural, botanical elements", "valueEs": "Blanco con elementos naturales y botánicos"}, {"keyCa": "Presentació",