he pace outside.\n\nA **fresh yet deep** fragrance, where the green character of matcha and green leaves combines with the delicacy of white tea. Clean and enveloping, it brings freshness without feeling light, creating an atmosphere of calm and wellbeing.\n\nPresented in a **reusable cement container**, designed to be kept and used again with Hotel Spa refills.\n\nAlso available as a **refill, Wax Melt and Discovery Cube.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Matcha · Green leaves · White tea** Matcha brings a green, serene character, joined by the freshness of green leaves and the delicacy of white tea. A fresh yet deep, clean and enveloping composition that evokes the atmosphere of a hotel spa.	Talabot Studio	28.93	\N	21.00	35.00	EUR	1	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Fresc, verd i profund", "valueEn": "Fresh, green and deep", "valueEs": "Fresco, verde y profundo"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Matcha · Fulles verdes · Te blanc", "valueEn": "Matcha · Green leaves · White tea", "valueEs": "Matcha · Hojas verdes · Té blanco"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "300 g", "valueEn": "300 g", "valueEs": "300 g"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Ciment reutilitzable amb tapa", "valueEn": "Reusable cement with lid", "valueEs": "Cemento reutilizable con tapa"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 9 × 10 cm", "valueEn": "Ø 9 × 10 cm", "valueEs": "Ø 9 × 10 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Cotó Premium de 55 capes", "valueEn": "55-ply premium cotton", "valueEs": "Algodón Premium de 55 capas"}, {"keyCa": "Recarregable", "keyEn": "Refillable", "keyEs