ner.\n\nA warm, enveloping fragrance where vanilla melts into toffee and a creamy accord, creating a sweet, comforting scent reminiscent of old-fashioned confectioners.\n\nHandmade in small batches with plant-based soy and coconut wax.\n\n**Scent notes**\n\nVanilla · Toffee · Cream	Talabot Studio	5.37	\N	21.00	6.50	EUR	5	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Gourmand · Cremós · Dolç", "valueEn": "Gourmand · Creamy · Sweet", "valueEs": "Gourmand · Cremoso · Dulce"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "58 g", "valueEn": "58 g", "valueEs": "58 g"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Vegetal de soja i coco", "valueEn": "Plant-based soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Vegetal de soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "4,5 × 11,5 cm", "valueEn": "4.5 × 11.5 cm", "valueEs": "4,5 × 11,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Presentació", "keyEn": "Packaging", "keyEs": "Presentación", "valueCa": "Caixa de cartró a mida", "valueEn": "Custom-made cardboard box", "valueEs": "Caja de cartón a medida"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Fet a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Handmade in small batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Hecho a mano en pequeños lotes en Barcelona"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:08:57.61	2026-11-05 11:33:53.115	14	7	60	7	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-18 22:13:19.558	f	\N	\N	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	null	Carrer de València 190, 08011 Barcelona, España · info@talabotstudio.com	Talabot Studio	Separa una o dos porciones de la tableta y colócalas en la parte superior de un quemador apto para wax melts. La cera se fundirá lentamente liberando la fragancia.\n\nNo añadir agua. No ingerir. No dejar el quemador encendido sin supervisión.\n\nMantener fuera del alcance de menores y mascotas y alejado de la luz solar directa.	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	