se agita, que observa sin interferir. En esa quietud, los detalles aparecen con más claridad, sin esfuerzo.\n\nSeijaku no impone silencio. Lo revela.\n\nY en ese espacio contenido, donde nada sobra y nada falta, todo simplemente… es.\n\n**Características:**\n\n- Vela en envase de vidrio negro con tapa personalizada Komorebi artesanal.\n- 210 g de cera de soja sin parafinas.\n- Pabilo de algodón.\n- Esencias premium veganas, libres de ftalatos y parabenos, y certificadas por IFRA.\n- Opción con caja personalizada de la marca (ideal para regalar o regalarte).\n- Ideal para las y los amantes de la cultura japonesa.\n\n**Pirámide olfativa:**\n\n- **Notas altas:** pera e higo.\n- **Notas medias:** jazmín, madreselva y peonía.\n- **Notas de fondo:** ámbar, vetiver y almizcle.	*Seijaku…* deep stillness.\n\nIn Japan it is not simply the absence of sound. It is a calm you can feel in the space, as if everything were in balance without needing to move.\n\nSeijaku is that state. It is not emptiness. It is not isolation. It is presence.\n\nIt can be found in a temple at dawn, in a motionless garden, in the instant before something happens. There is no tension, no hurry. Only a sense of natural order.\n\nIt is related to Zen: the mind that doesn't stir, that observes without interfering. In that stillness, details appear more clearly, effortlessly.\n\nSeijaku doesn't impose silence. It reveals it.\n\nAnd in that contained space, where nothing is missing and nothing is too much, everything simply… is.\n\n**Features:**\n\n- Candle in a black glass jar with a custom Komorebi artesanal lid.\n- 210 g of paraffin-free soy wax.\n- Cotton wick.\n- Vegan premium essences, free from phthalates and parabens, and IFRA-certified.\n- Option with the brand's custom gift box (ideal as a gift, or a treat for yourself).\n- Ideal for lovers of Japanese culture.\n\n**Fragrance pyramid:**\n\n- **Top notes:** pear and fig.\n- **Middle notes:** jasmine, honeysuckle and peony.\n- **Base notes:** amber,