o en la plantilla, la pieza se prensa y se seca de forma natural, sin cocción, así que cada baldosa es única.\n\n**Suport Fusta 20.** Soporte de madera clara con calado hexagonal, pensado para la Rajola Gaudí 1904.	This pack brings together **Rajola Gaudí 1904**, the 20 cm replica of La Pedrera's hydraulic tile, and **Suport Fusta 20**, the wooden stand that holds it upright. A collector's piece ready to display, and a meaningful gift for the Gaudí centenary (1926-2026).\n\n**Rajola Gaudí 1904.** A replica of the original hydraulic cement tile Antoni Gaudí designed in 1904 and that was laid on the floors of Casa Milà, La Pedrera. A hexagonal tile with the relief as originally designed (a starfish, a conch shell and seaweed), wrapped in an embossed card band. The tile is handmade by Mosaics Martí, a hydraulic tile workshop in Manresa since 1913: the colour is poured by hand into the mould, the piece is pressed and cures naturally, without firing, so every tile is one of a kind.\n\n**Suport Fusta 20.** A light wooden display stand with a hexagonal cut-out, made for the Rajola Gaudí 1904.	Mosaics Martí	41.32	\N	21.00	50.00	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Inclou", "keyEn": "Includes", "keyEs": "Incluye", "valueCa": "Rajola Gaudí 1904 + Suport Fusta 20", "valueEn": "Rajola Gaudí 1904 tile + Suport Fusta 20 stand", "valueEs": "Rajola Gaudí 1904 + Suport Fusta 20"}, {"keyCa": "Disseny", "keyEn": "Design", "keyEs": "Diseño", "valueCa": "Antoni Gaudí, 1904 (Casa Milà, La Pedrera)", "valueEn": "Antoni Gaudí, 1904 (Casa Milà, La Pedrera)", "valueEs": "Antoni Gaudí, 1904 (Casa Milà, La Pedrera)"}, {"keyCa": "Material", "keyEn": "Material", "keyEs": "Material", "valueCa": "Mosaic hidràulic fet a mà i fusta", "valueEn": "Handmade hydraulic cement tile and wood", "valueEs": "Mosaico hidráulico hecho a mano y madera"}, {"keyCa": "Color", "keyEn": "Colour", "keyEs": "Color", "valueCa": "Verd", "valueEn": "Green", "valueEs": "Verde"}, {"keyCa": "Mides de la rajola", "keyEn": "Tile dimen