tly musky base.\n\n**A formula created in the Lab and produced in a very limited edition of 1 to 3 units.**\n\n**Scent notes**\n\n**Bergamot · Citrus · Green tea**\n\nBergamot brings a fresh, citrus and slightly bitter opening. The citrus notes heighten its brightness, while green tea adds a leafy, aromatic nuance that brings lightness and balance.	Talabot Studio	8.68	\N	21.00	10.50	EUR	2	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Cítric, fresc i dolç", "valueEn": "Citrus, fresh and green", "valueEs": "Cítrico, fresco y verde"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Bergamota · Cítrics · Te verd", "valueEn": "Bergamot · Citrus · Green tea", "valueEs": "Bergamota · Cítricos · Té verde"}, {"keyCa": "Contingut", "keyEn": "Contents", "keyEs": "Contenido", "valueCa": "100 g", "valueEn": "100 g", "valueEs": "100 g"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre verd amb tapa platejada", "valueEn": "Green glass with silver lid", "valueEs": "Vidrio verde con tapa plateada"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm", "valueEn": "Ø 5 × 6.5 cm", "valueEs": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Stabilo", "valueEn": "Stabilo", "valueEs": "Stabilo"}, {"keyCa": "Edició", "keyEn": "Edition", "keyEs": "Edición", "valueCa": "Entre 1 i 3 unitats", "valueEn": "Between 1 and 3 units", "valueEs": "Entre 1 y 3 unidades"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Feta a mà en petits lots a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Hand-poured in micro-batches in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Vertida a mano en micro lotes en Barcelona"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:09:12.908	2026-11-05 11:33:49.149	9	7	22