re**\n\nRose sits at the heart of the composition, joined by raspberry and **redcurrant**, which add a fruity nuance. Cashmere, **vanilla** and amber form a **soft**, warm and enveloping base.	Talabot Studio	8.68	\N	21.00	10.50	EUR	3	NEW	ACTIVE	[{"keyCa": "Caràcter olfactiu", "keyEn": "Scent profile", "keyEs": "Carácter olfativo", "valueCa": "Floral · Afruitat · Dolç · Sofisticat", "valueEn": "Floral · Fruity · Sweet · Enveloping", "valueEs": "Floral · Afrutado · Dulce · Envolvente"}, {"keyCa": "Notes olfactives", "keyEn": "Scent notes", "keyEs": "Notas olfativas", "valueCa": "Rosa · Fruits vermells · Caixmir", "valueEn": "Rose · Red berries · Cashmere", "valueEs": "Rosa · Frutos rojos · Cashmere"}, {"keyCa": "Pes", "keyEn": "Weight", "keyEs": "Peso", "valueCa": "100 g", "valueEn": "100 g", "valueEs": "100 g"}, {"keyCa": "Cera", "keyEn": "Wax", "keyEs": "Cera", "valueCa": "Soja i coco", "valueEn": "Soy and coconut", "valueEs": "Soja y coco"}, {"keyCa": "Recipient", "keyEn": "Container", "keyEs": "Recipiente", "valueCa": "Vidre verd amb tapa platejada", "valueEn": "Green glass with silver lid", "valueEs": "Vidrio verde con tapa plateada"}, {"keyCa": "Mides", "keyEn": "Dimensions", "keyEs": "Medidas", "valueCa": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm", "valueEn": "Ø 5 × 6.5 cm", "valueEs": "Ø 5 × 6,5 cm"}, {"keyCa": "Metxa", "keyEn": "Wick", "keyEs": "Mecha", "valueCa": "Stabilo", "valueEn": "Stabilo", "valueEs": "Stabilo"}, {"keyCa": "Edició", "keyEn": "Edition", "keyEs": "Edición", "valueCa": "Microedició limitada d'entre 1 i 3 unitats", "valueEn": "Limited micro-batch of 1 to 3 units", "valueEs": "Micro lote de entre 1 y 3 unidades"}, {"keyCa": "Elaboració", "keyEn": "Made", "keyEs": "Elaboración", "valueCa": "Feta a mà a Barcelona", "valueEn": "Hand-poured in Barcelona", "valueEs": "Vertida a mano en Barcelona"}]	0	0	2026-10-19 00:09:15.175	2026-11-05 11:33:51.173	9	7	220	7	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-10-18 22:10:22.618	f	g	100.000	0	t	f	\N	\N	\N	null	Carrer de València 190, 08011 Barcelona, Esp