timulation\n- On rainy or low-exercise days, to satisfy the natural urge to gnaw\n- Between meals, as a functional snack with cartilage and connective tissue\n\n**Feeding guidelines**\nOne foot a day for dogs under 10 kg, two for medium or large dogs. Each foot weighs around 13 g and provides about 45 kcal. Not a substitute for a balanced diet.\n\n**Storage and responsible use**\n- Keep the bag in a cool, dry place, well sealed after each use, away from direct sunlight\n- No preservatives: avoid moisture and use within the period indicated on the packaging\n- Supervise chewing, especially with dogs that eat greedily\n- Always keep fresh water available\n\n**Analytical constituents**\n- Crude protein: 55.0%\n- Crude fat: 28.0%\n- Crude fibre: 1.0%\n- Crude ash: 12.0%\n- Moisture: 6.0%	Brau	6.32	\N	10.00	6.95	EUR	0	NEW	ACTIVE	[]	0	0	2026-09-13 14:22:04.037	2026-11-05 11:34:41.483	15	30	760	30	FET_A_CATALUNYA	2026-09-14 05:37:00.887	t	g	250.000	0	f	f	\N	\N	\N	{"storageEs": "", "allergensEs": "", "businessName": "", "ingredientsEs": "CA: 100% pollastre. ES: 100% pollo. EN: 100% chicken."}	\N	Brau Snacks	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N	\N	f	t	\N	\N	\N	200	t	0	f	\N	https://brausnacks.com/ca/products/patas-de-pollo	f	\N	\N	0	{}
